  "question": {
    "text": "$\\vec{a}=3 \\hat{i}-5 \\hat{j}$ and $\\vec{b}=6 \\hat{i}+3 \\hat{j}$ are two vectors and $\\vec{c}$ is a vector such that $\\vec{c}=\\vec{a} \\times \\vec{b}$ then\n$$\n|\\vec{a}|:|\\vec{b}|:|\\vec{c}|\n$$",
